 "notes": "speed is m/s round the circle; orbit.radius [min,max] lets up/down move in and out; mouse_speed lets the pointer lead fast. player_laser is a beam (kind beam, relative: it follows the hero and stays on its target however fast the hero runs) that bites actors tagged \"boss\"; it lives 60 s and refires every 59.9, so clear only the enemy shots (emitter.clear {ids}) or it is gone for a minute; swap it with emitter.set to power it up."
}